+/*
+ * decode-uri-component 0.5.1 (https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component), vendored by
+ * Parkio and converted to CommonJS. query-string 7.1.3 requires a CommonJS decoder, and 0.5.1, the
+ * first release with the fix for CVE-2026-118664 (GHSA-qr28-fpjm-wq7f), is ESM-only. Only the
+ * module syntax differs from upstream: `export default function` became `module.exports =`.
+ *
